---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Type and token specimen"
  description="Internal review page for the Algorithm Stories type scale, colour tokens, spacing, radii, shadows, and motion."
  noindex
>
  <div class="specimen page-shell">
    <header class="specimen__intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Internal · not indexed</p>
      <h1 class="specimen__title">Type and token specimen</h1>
      <p class="specimen__dek">
        A visual review surface for the paper and stage systems. All samples read from
        <code>src/styles/tokens.css</code>; nothing on this page defines its own colour, size,
        spacing, radius, shadow, or timing value.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="specimen__section" aria-labelledby="faces-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="faces-title">The three voices</h2>
        <p class="eyebrow">Display · Body · Data</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faces">
        <article class="face">
          <p class="eyebrow">Instrument Serif · 400</p>
          <p class="face__glyphs" aria-hidden="true">Aa</p>
          <p class="face__alphabet">
            ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ<br />
            abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz<br />
            0123456789 &amp; ? ! . , ; :
          </p>
          <p class="face__italic">Italic: the colony finds a short route.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="face">
          <p class="eyebrow">Geist · variable 100–900</p>
          <p class="face__body-sample">The colony finds a short route.</p>
          <p class="face__copy">
            Good body type disappears into the argument. Geist carries long passages at a
            comfortable measure, keeps counters open at small sizes, and pairs with the serif
            without competing for attention.
          </p>
          <p class="face__weights">
            <span style="font-weight: var(--weight-regular)">400 Regular</span>
            <span style="font-weight: var(--weight-medium)">500 Medium</span>
            <span style="font-weight: var(--weight-semibold)">600 Semibold</span>
            <span style="font-weight: var(--weight-bold)">700 Bold</span>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="face">
          <p class="eyebrow">JetBrains Mono · variable 100–800</p>
          <p class="face__mono-sample">0123456789<br />2.71828 · 0.500 · 42</p>
          <pre class="code-surface"><code>for ant in colony:
  tour = construct(ant, tau, eta)
  deposit(tour)
  evaporate(tau, rho)</code></pre>
          <p class="face__copy data">tabular figures · 1,024 iterations · 0.731</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="specimen__note">
        Fallbacks are metric-matched local faces: Times New Roman/Liberation Serif for Instrument
        Serif, Arial/Liberation Sans for Geist, and DejaVu Sans Mono/Menlo/Consolas for JetBrains
        Mono. <code>size-adjust</code>, <code>ascent-override</code>, <code>descent-override</code>,
        and <code>line-gap-override</code> keep line breaks and block heights close during the
        swap. Only the two critical faces are preloaded.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="specimen__section" aria-labelledby="scale-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="scale-title">Type scale</h2>
        <p class="eyebrow">Clamped for 320 px → 1440 px</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="scale">
        <li class="scale__row">
          <code class="scale__token">--text-display</code>
          <span class="scale__sample" style="font-size: var(--text-display)">Aa</span>
          <span class="scale__use">Hero display</span>
        </li>
        <li class="scale__row">
          <code class="scale__token">--text-h1</code>
          <span class="scale__sample" style="font-size: var(--text-h1)">Aa</span>
          <span class="scale__use">Page title</span>
        </li>
        <li class="scale__row">
          <code class="scale__token">--text-h2</code>
          <span class="scale__sample" style="font-size: var(--text-h2)">Aa</span>
          <span class="scale__use">Section title</span>
        </li>
        <li class="scale__row">
          <code class="scale__token">--text-h3</code>
          <span class="scale__sample" style="font-size: var(--text-h3)">Aa</span>
          <span class="scale__use">Card and chapter</span>
        </li>
        <li class="scale__row">
          <code class="scale__token">--text-lead</code>
          <span class="scale__sample" style="font-size: var(--text-lead)">Aa</span>
          <span class="scale__use">Deck</span>
        </li>
        <li class="scale__row">
          <code class="scale__token">--text-body</code>
          <span class="scale__sample" style="font-size: var(--text-body)">Aa</span>
          <span class="scale__use">Reading text</span>
        </li>
        <li class="scale__row">
          <code class="scale__token">--text-sm</code>
          <span class="scale__sample" style="font-size: var(--text-sm)">Aa</span>
          <span class="scale__use">Captions</span>
        </li>
        <li class="scale__row">
          <code class="scale__token">--text-xs</code>
          <span class="scale__sample" style="font-size: var(--text-xs)">Aa</span>
          <span class="scale__use">Labels</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="specimen__section" aria-labelledby="colour-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="colour-title">Colour on both grounds</h2>
        <p class="eyebrow">Normative pairs · WCAG 2.2 AA</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grounds">
        <article class="ground ground--paper">
          <h3 class="ground__title">On paper</h3>
          <ul class="swatches">
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-paper)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Paper</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-paper</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">Page ground</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-ink)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Ink</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-ink</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">16.02:1</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-paper-muted)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Paper muted</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-paper-muted</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">5.87:1</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-accent-paper)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Accent on paper</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-accent-paper</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">5.20:1</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-focus)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Focus ring</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-focus</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">4.62:1 · UI</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-accent-stage)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Vermilion, large only</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-accent-stage</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">3.20:1 · large/graphic</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="ground ground--stage">
          <h3 class="ground__title">On stage</h3>
          <ul class="swatches">
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-stage)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Stage</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-stage</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">Instrument ground</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-stage-ink)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Stage ink</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-stage-ink</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">17.02:1</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-stage-muted)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Stage muted</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-stage-muted</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">6.50:1</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-accent-stage)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Accent on stage</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-accent-stage</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">5.31:1</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-focus)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Focus ring</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-focus</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">3.68:1 · UI</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-amber)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Warm amber</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-amber</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">10.98:1 · graphic</span>
            </li>
            <li class="swatch">
              <span class="swatch__chip" style="background-color: var(--color-cool)"></span>
              <span class="swatch__name">Cool accent</span>
              <code class="swatch__token">--color-cool</code>
              <span class="swatch__ratio">14.64:1 · graphic</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="stage stage--specimen">
        <div class="stage__surface stage--specimen__surface">
          <p class="eyebrow stage__eyebrow">Stage sample</p>
          <p class="stage__headline">The colony is a probability field with legs.</p>
          <p class="stage__caption">
            Stage ink for prose, stage muted for labels, vermilion for the current best tour, amber
            for ants and warm data, cool for comparison data.
          </p>
          <div class="stage__chips">
            <span class="stage__chip stage__chip--amber">Amber · ants</span>
            <span class="stage__chip stage__chip--cool">Cool · best tour</span>
            <span class="stage__chip stage__chip--accent">Vermilion · highlight</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="specimen__section" aria-labelledby="spacing-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="spacing-title">Spacing, radii, shadows</h2>
        <p class="eyebrow">4 px base · restrained surfaces</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="spacing">
        <li class="spacing__row">
          <code class="spacing__token">--space-2xs</code>
          <span class="spacing__bar" style="width: var(--space-2xs)"></span>
        </li>
        <li class="spacing__row">
          <code class="spacing__token">--space-xs</code>
          <span class="spacing__bar" style="width: var(--space-xs)"></span>
        </li>
        <li class="spacing__row">
          <code class="spacing__token">--space-sm</code>
          <span class="spacing__bar" style="width: var(--space-sm)"></span>
        </li>
        <li class="spacing__row">
          <code class="spacing__token">--space-md</code>
          <span class="spacing__bar" style="width: var(--space-md)"></span>
        </li>
        <li class="spacing__row">
          <code class="spacing__token">--space-lg</code>
          <span class="spacing__bar" style="width: var(--space-lg)"></span>
        </li>
        <li class="spacing__row">
          <code class="spacing__token">--space-xl</code>
          <span class="spacing__bar" style="width: var(--space-xl)"></span>
        </li>
        <li class="spacing__row">
          <code class="spacing__token">--space-2xl</code>
          <span class="spacing__bar" style="width: var(--space-2xl)"></span>
        </li>
        <li class="spacing__row">
          <code class="spacing__token">--space-3xl</code>
          <span class="spacing__bar" style="width: var(--space-3xl)"></span>
        </li>
        <li class="spacing__row">
          <code class="spacing__token">--space-4xl</code>
          <span class="spacing__bar" style="width: var(--space-4xl)"></span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="surfaces">
        <div class="surface">
          <p class="eyebrow">Radii</p>
          <div class="radius-row">
            <span class="radius-box" style="border-radius: var(--radius-xs)">xs</span>
            <span class="radius-box" style="border-radius: var(--radius-sm)">sm</span>
            <span class="radius-box" style="border-radius: var(--radius-md)">md</span>
            <span class="radius-box" style="border-radius: var(--radius-lg)">lg</span>
            <span class="radius-box" style="border-radius: var(--radius-xl)">xl</span>
            <span class="radius-box" style="border-radius: var(--radius-pill)">pill</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="surface">
          <p class="eyebrow">Shadows</p>
          <div class="shadow-row">
            <span class="shadow-card shadow-card--paper">--shadow-paper</span>
            <span class="shadow-card shadow-card--stage">--shadow-panel</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="specimen__section" aria-labelledby="motion-title">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="motion-title">Motion</h2>
        <p class="eyebrow">Strong ease-out · 400–900 ms for explanation</p>
      </div>

      <div class="motion-list">
        <div class="motion-row">
          <code class="motion-row__token">--duration-calm · --ease-calm</code>
          <span class="motion-track"><span class="motion-dot motion-dot--calm"></span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="motion-row">
          <code class="motion-row__token">--duration-slow · --ease-out</code>
          <span class="motion-track"><span class="motion-dot motion-dot--slow"></span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="motion-row">
          <code class="motion-row__token">--duration-act · --ease-out</code>
          <span class="motion-track"><span class="motion-dot motion-dot--act"></span></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="specimen__note">
        Direct UI feedback uses <code>--duration-instant</code> and <code>--duration-quick</code>.
        Explanatory movement stays in the calm range; no bouncy springs. Under reduced motion the
        duration tokens collapse to 1 ms and animation is disabled by <code>base.css</code>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .specimen {
    padding-block-start: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .specimen__intro {
    max-inline-size: var(--measure-prose);
    padding-block-end: var(--space-2xl);
    border-block-end: var(--hairline) solid var(--color-rule-paper);
  }

  .specimen__title {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter);
  }

  .specimen__dek {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-md);
    color: var(--color-paper-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .specimen__section {
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
    border-block-end: var(--hairline) solid var(--color-rule-paper);
  }

  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-block-end: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
  }

  .specimen__note {
    max-inline-size: var(--measure-prose);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--color-paper-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .specimen code {
    font-size: 0.92em;
  }

  /* Faces */
  .faces {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 18rem), 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .face {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .face__glyphs {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-display);
    line-height: var(--leading-none);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter);
  }

  .face__alphabet {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
  }

  .face__italic {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .face__body-sample {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
  }

  .face__copy {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .face__weights {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-xs) var(--space-md);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-md);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .face__mono-sample {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
  }

  .face .code-surface {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
  }

  /* Scale */
  .scale {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .scale__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(8rem, 12rem) 1fr auto;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-block: var(--space-sm);
    border-block-start: var(--hairline) solid var(--color-rule-paper);
  }

  .scale__row:last-child {
    border-block-end: var(--hairline) solid var(--color-rule-paper);
  }

  .scale__token {
    color: var(--color-paper-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .scale__sample {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    line-height: var(--leading-none);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
  }

  .scale__use {
    color: var(--color-paper-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  /* Colour */
  .grounds {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 22rem), 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .ground {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .ground--paper {
    border: var(--hairline) solid var(--color-rule-paper);
    background-color: var(--color-paper-raised);
  }

  .ground--stage {
    background-color: var(--color-stage);
    color: var(--color-stage-ink);
  }

  .ground__title {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
  }

  .swatches {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 11rem), 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-md);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .swatches li + li {
    margin-block-start: 0;
  }

  .swatch {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3xs);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .swatch__chip {
    display: block;
    height: var(--space-xl);
    border: var(--hairline) solid var(--color-rule-paper);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .ground--stage .swatch__chip {
    border-color: var(--color-rule-stage);
  }

  .swatch__name {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
  }

  .swatch__token {
    color: var(--color-paper-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-2xs);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .swatch__ratio {
    color: var(--color-paper-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-2xs);
  }

  .ground--stage .swatch__token,
  .ground--stage .swatch__ratio {
    color: var(--color-stage-muted);
  }

  .stage--specimen {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .stage--specimen__surface {
    aspect-ratio: auto;
    padding: clamp(var(--space-md), 5vw, var(--space-2xl));
  }

  .stage__eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-stage-muted);
  }

  .stage__headline {
    max-inline-size: var(--measure-narrow);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
  }

  .stage__caption {
    max-inline-size: var(--measure-prose);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-stage-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }

  .stage__chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-md);
  }

  .stage__chip {
    padding: var(--space-3xs) var(--space-2xs);
    border: var(--hairline) solid currentcolor;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-2xs);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
  }

  .stage__chip--amber {
    color: var(--color-amber);
  }

  .stage__chip--cool {
    color: var(--color-cool);
  }

  .stage__chip--accent {
    color: var(--color-accent-stage);
  }

  /* Spacing */
  .spacing {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .spacing__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: var(--space-3xs);
  }

  .spacing__row + .spacing__row {
    margin-block-start: 0;
  }

  .spacing__token {
    color: var(--color-paper-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
  }

  .spacing__bar {
    display: block;
    height: var(--space-2xs);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    background-color: var(--color-accent-paper);
  }

  .surfaces {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 20rem), 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .radius-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .radius-box {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: var(--space-3xl);
    height: var(--space-xl);
    border: var(--hairline) solid var(--color-rule-paper);
    background-color: var(--color-paper-inset);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-2xs);
  }

  .shadow-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-md);
  }

  .shadow-card {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: var(--space-4xl);
    height: var(--space-3xl);
